---
name: qa-latency-gate
severity: error
on:
  - edit
where:
  - "docs/proofs/agentpm/**/*.json"
  - "ci/guards/**"
then:
  - run: make -s guards.qa.latency
    message: "QA proofs must have latency_ms > 0 and non-empty analysis."
---
Proofs must be meaningful: latency_ms > 0; analysis non-empty; used flag (if present) truthy.